ys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L7)\n\nState interface for the KeyStateTracker.\n\n## Properties\n\n### heldCodes\n\n```ts\nheldCodes: Record<string, string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L16)\n\nMap from normalized key name to the physical `event.code` (e.g. \"KeyA\", \"ShiftLeft\").\nUseful for debugging which physical key was pressed.\n\n***\n\n### heldKeys\n\n```ts\nheldKeys: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L11)\n\nArray of currently held key names (normalized, e.g. \"Control\", \"A\").\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: KeyStateTrackerState\ntitle: KeyStateTrackerState\n---\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:7](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L7)\n\nState interface for the KeyStateTracker.\n\n## Properties\n\n### heldCodes\n\n```ts\nheldCodes: Record<string, string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L16)\n\nMap from normalized key name to the physical `event.code` (e.g. \"KeyA\", \"ShiftLeft\").\nUseful for debugging which physical key was pressed.\n\n***\n\n### heldKeys\n\n```ts\nheldKeys: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [key-state-tracker.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key-state-tracker.ts#L11)\n\nArray of currently held key names (normalized, e.g. \"Control\", \"A\").\n"}
